=== meta ===
rule: BROAD_EXCEPT_ADDED
title: a relay in a test mixin whose collecting class has an imported base is read though the file has no unit
origin: MagicStack/uvloop 7b202ccf (tests/test_context.py): its tests live in `class _ContextBaseTests:` and run through `Test_UV_Context(_ContextBaseTests, tb.UVTestCase)`, so the parse has no unit (2026-10-29 status review, DF0)
note: the parse finds no unit, because the collecting class's base is imported, and R2b, not the presence of units, keeps the relay to a handed-off callback; the .pyx edit is an opaque production change, so on 0.10 the added handler is refused the opaque credit and blocks with OPAQUE_PROD_CHANGE_NOT_EVIDENCE (D-176, D-187); as a proven failure relay it is not counted as added (SPEC §4, D-190); the label is Claude's, set under the 2026-10-27 delegation (D-190)
